### Get books list
GET http://localhost:3001/api/books HTTP/1.1

### Get book by id
GET http://localhost:3001/api/books/1 HTTP/1.1

### Create book
POST http://localhost:3001/api/books HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Wiedźmin", 
  "author": "Sapkowski", 
  "year": 1993
}

### Update user
PUT http://localhost:3000/users/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Paweł"
}

### Delete user
DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/1 HTTP/1.1